  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      310.91,
      264.48,
      604.18
    ],
    "text": "The sea areas off the coasts extending from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be rough at times with strong gusty winds up to (50-60) kmph. The wave height may increase about (2.0 \u2013 2.5) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Matara. The naval and fishing communities who are engaged in fishing and naval activities in the above sea areas are requested to be vigilant in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
